{
  "description": "Godot-shaped runtime compatibility for imported games. Translated GDScript keeps Godot API calls; language syntax and source-only constructs are lowered by gd-analyze, while all ClassDB runtime behavior lives here against native Three.js, PixiJS, Rapier, Web Audio, browser, and engine primitives. The four executable object-dispatch tables are the sole ClassDB binding inventory consumed by both emitted code and coverage reports; reports derive from those same executable declarations rather than a parallel inventory. This copied-in capability is project-owned and implements Godot protocols top-down from the pinned engine API/source, with fixture evidence used to verify rather than define the surface.",
